                                "sense_id": "19f3f23f-10de-3429-ba0d-b405ca97bf0d",
                                "text": "Well, I seem to recall Tori and Patrick being seen together, and a reference in People comes to mind, with a photo attached. I'm not for sure that Patrick is completely gay, but he's at least bi according to a person I know with first hand experience. Perhaps we have a dual merkin-beard relationship here, eh?"
