                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "609149be-60d7-3c76-b739-1566973e7047",
                        "entry_id": "f76b049d-e0fd-363d-9c11-a6ca7609f736",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An American."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "British",
                            "derogatory",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a9b5cd0-4256-4434-930b-401e4ffb9541",
                                "sense_id": "609149be-60d7-3c76-b739-1566973e7047",
                                "text": "For all you non-'merkins: Most 'merkins are idiots, just like the residents of your country. See, most people are idiots. We just have idiots with a higher average income than you do, so they can afford to be better cretins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "71c092cd-7b6b-4206-98df-05843171f634",
                                "sense_id": "609149be-60d7-3c76-b739-1566973e7047",
                                "text": "It is, unfortunately, an all-to-common assumption -- sort of like assuming that all posters here are 'merkins. Perhaps it's best to assume that all posters are vertebrates (I was going to type primates, but one of my neutered cats sent a post awhile^([sic]) back)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72aa2cdf-659b-4425-b455-0d1e9ca795ef",
                                "sense_id": "609149be-60d7-3c76-b739-1566973e7047",
                                "text": "There is a brand of cheap, nasty aftershave over in Britain caller Que. About two quid a bottle and it's foul. Buy some and fly to Noo Yawk. Then sell it to a Murkin for forty bucks. Tell them it is Calvin Klein's British version."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "059536c4-8ec4-4cf8-a194-a07734e5d25f",
                                "sense_id": "609149be-60d7-3c76-b739-1566973e7047",
                                "text": "Well he did say he doesn't follow the sport so it is understandable that he isn't aware of the four year rotation (soon to be changed to 2 years if FIFA (the internatinal football body for you unknowing merkins) have their way). I couldn't tell you sod all about the 'World' Series as I don't follow Baseball."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
