                                "sense_id": "576ff99a-e73d-3415-a070-630caf7275f0",
                                "text": "From its origins as a solution for pubic lice and syphilis to its use in the entertainment and sex industries, the merkin has played a vital role in the evolution of human sexuality and body modification.",
